# Defense-in-depth: flutter_app/android/.gitignore already covers
# key.properties/*.jks/*.keystore under android/, but a keystore
# generated from the repo root (e.g. by running keytool without cd-ing
# into flutter_app/android first — a real near-miss, 2026-09-02) isn't
# covered by that scoped .gitignore at all. Never commit a signing key.
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties
